<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Incitec year net profit jumps 50 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Incitec year net profit jumps 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   111.40 vs 66.67</p>
<p>    Net				     60.08 vs 40.07</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    24.50 vs 18.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Incitec Ltd is a fertiliser and chemical manufacturer and is about 69.66 percent owned by ICI Australia Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    40.00 vs 27.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  945.37 vs 796.18</p>
<p>    Other income			   9.47 vs 10.49</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    55.1 vs 37.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date December 20</p>
<p>Reg date December 2</p>
<p>    Tax				     42.86 vs 22.01</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.99 vs 5.64</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  23.18 vs 22.04</p>
<p>    Minorities			     8.46 vs 4.59</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
